Phase 4 - Create cPanel Mailboxes
First create API Token in WHM.
Login to WHM:
Development
    Manage API Tokens
Create:
ansible-token
Save token.
________________________________________
Role:
roles/cpanel_mailbox/tasks/main.yml
Example:
- name: Create mailbox
  uri:

    url: >-
      https://100.125.194.89:2083/execute/Email/add_pop

    method: POST

    validate_certs: false

    headers:
      Authorization: "cpanel root:{{ cpanel_api_token }}"

    body_format: form-urlencoded

    body:

      email: "{{ item.username }}"
      domain: linoop.us
      password: "{{ item.password }}"
      quota: 1024

  loop: "{{ processed_users }}"
________________________________________
Phase 5 - Create Active Directory Users
You'll need a Windows server with:
RSAT-AD-PowerShell
installed.
Inventory:
windows:
  hosts:
    dc01:
      ansible_host: 10.0.0.10
Role:
roles/active_directory/tasks/main.yml
- name: Create AD users
  win_domain_user:

    name: "{{ item.username }}"

    upn: "{{ item.ad_user }}"

    password: "{{ item.password }}"

    email: "{{ item.mailbox }}"

    enabled: yes

    password_never_expires: no

  loop: "{{ processed_users }}"
________________________________________
Phase 6 - Create Zoom Users
Create:
Zoom Server-to-Server OAuth App
Get:
Account ID
Client ID
Client Secret
Role:
roles/zoom_users/tasks/main.yml
- name: Create Zoom user
  uri:

    url: https://api.zoom.us/v2/users

    method: POST

    headers:
      Authorization: "Bearer {{ zoom_access_token }}"

    body_format: json

    body:

      action: create

      user_info:

        email: "{{ item.zoom_user }}"

        type: 1

        first_name: "{{ item.fullname.split()[0] }}"

        last_name: "{{ item.fullname.split()[-1] }}"

  loop: "{{ processed_users }}"
