Main Playbook
---
- hosts: localhost

  gather_facts: false

  vars_files:
    - vars/users.yml

  roles:

    - generate_accounts
    - cpanel_mailbox
    - active_directory
    - zoom_users
    - email_notification
________________________________________
Suggested Execution Order
1.	Create a WHM API token on your cPanel server. 
2.	Create a Zoom Server-to-Server OAuth application. 
3.	Verify WinRM connectivity to your AD server. 
4.	Test creating one user only (e.g., Sajjad Shafiq). 
5.	Verify: 
o	Mailbox created 
o	AD account created 
o	Zoom invitation sent 
6.	Run against all 17 users. 
7.	Generate a CSV report and archive it for future onboarding audits. 
This approach scales well—whether you're onboarding 17 users or 500 users, you only update vars/users.yml and rerun the playbook.

